#
# Whether a category is over its budget, in Sutra (larder_rules.h LR2): a
# budget set (at least one minor unit) and an excess, spent - budget, of
# at least one minor unit. Both fields are s9(18): a value past 18 digits
# is a size error, refused, where over.eve answers FALSE: held. The model
# shows a category as over only when both say TRUE.
record larder-over
  budget: s9(18)
  excess: s9(18)
procedure
  answer budget >= 1 and excess >= 1
